        <mj-text color="#FA4616" font-size="10px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.4px" padding="0 0 7px">FRANZ BEARD</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#081F3D" font-size="22px" line-height="1.18" font-weight="900" padding="0 0 8px">Keep the Ball Away From Trinidad Chambliss</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#566274" font-size="14px" line-height="1.5" padding="0 0 12px">Florida’s run game is the clearest path to controlling the matchup with No. 4 Ole Miss.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-best-way-for-the-gators-to-win-is-keep-the-ball-away-from-trinidad-chambliss?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter" align="left" padding="0 0 18px">READ THE ANALYSIS</mj-button>
