      <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 0 0 10px">
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/16b519_a0c1b7e3ce9846239402069349deab8c~mv2.jpg" alt="Aaron Philo runs for a first down at Auburn. Photo by Chris Spears / GatorBait Media." padding="0 0 10px" />
        <mj-text color="#FA4616" font-size="10px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.4px" padding="0 0 7px">INSIDE THE OFFENSE</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#081F3D" font-size="22px" line-height="1.18" font-weight="900" padding="0 0 8px">Buster Faulkner’s Offense Is Anything But Predictable</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#566274" font-size="14px" line-height="1.5" padding="0 0 12px">Franz Beard breaks down the calls and trust driving Florida’s early offensive surge.</mj-text>
